OL,3,GNEWSASummer camp abuser has sentence
OL,4,Aappeal rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA summer camp leader who fed boys
OL,7,Ftranquiliser-laced sweets before
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting them has lost an
OL,9,Fappeal to reduce the length of his
OL,10,Fprison sentence.
OL,12,FJon Ruben was jailed for 23 years and
OL,13,F10 months in February after his abuse
OL,14,Fcame to light when a number of children
OL,15,Fbecame unwell at a camp he was running
OL,16,Fin Stathern in Leicestershire in July
OL,17,F2025.
OL,19,FOn Friday, a panel of judges at the
OL,20,FCourt of Appeal rejected Ruben's bid to
OL,21,Freduce his sentence but corrected an
OL,22,Felement of how it was constructed.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
